<title>UK: Shire to sell Hoechst Marion products in UK.</title>
<headline>Shire to sell Hoechst Marion products in UK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shire Pharma Group Plc said it was appointed exclusive distributor in Britain for a range of specialist gynaecological products of Hoechst Marion Roussel, a unit of Hoechst AG.</p>
<p>Shire will market the products, which currently have combined annual sales of 3.5 million stg, at its own expense and receive returns on the basis of incremental sales growth.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
